            "startdescription": "The harsh environment has become our advantage, but not the enemy’s. Through the power of sky and atmospheric activity, this enemy force has been delayed by destructive weather and natural phenomena. They will be unable to engage us for some time.\n\n[The intensity of war has briefly diminished.]",
