            "previewdescription": "We must recognize this fact: adverse weather and difficult terrain will significantly hinder military operations, yet they are not merely our affliction. Now that they have become our advantage, I may attempt a course of action—one that the Edge-Hours might not entirely approve of, but one that the enemy will find even less tolerable.\n\n[This will delay the enemy's movements and slightly extinguish the spark of resistance, though the Edge-Hours may express some displeasure.]",
